    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Key elements in consumer notices",
     "texto": [
      "When analysing general contract conditions and cancellation guidelines, three components must be identified as a priority: the period for exercising the right (**innerhalb von + Dativ**), the mandatory requirements (**Voraussetzung ist, dass …** or **sofern der Kaufbeleg vorliegt**) and the express exceptions or exclusions (**ausgeschlossen von**)."
     ],
